// oracle: levels 4
// A long list runs over several pages: items break across pages, and the marker stays with the first
// frame of its item.
#set page(width: 300pt, height: 160pt, margin: 25pt)
- first item that wraps around the measure so that it takes two or three lines of the narrow page
- second item that likewise wraps around the narrow measure of this page and takes more lines
- third item with another long run of words that wraps around and flows onto a further line
- fourth item with yet more words to push the list over onto a following page of this document
+ fifth numbered after the break, with enough words to wrap onto a second line of this page
+ sixth
+ seventh with a few more words so that it wraps on the narrow measure of this very page
